          "version": "1.0",
          "type": "evidence-update",
          "date": "2026-09-22",
          "note": "Canonical 初版：依 SRC.MODERN-IMPL-CONSENSUS 建立並通過 golden/unit 驗證。"
        }
      ]
    }
